---
import AdminLayout from '../../layouts/AdminLayout.astro';
import { getSession } from '../../server/auth';
import { listCategories, listManagedResources } from '../../server/store';
import { getSettings } from '../../server/settings';
const session = getSession(Astro.request);
if (!session) return Astro.redirect('/admin/login/');
if (session.user.role !== 'admin') return Astro.redirect('/admin/');
const categories = listCategories();
// 与服务端保存规则保持一致：只有仍在公开目录中的资源才是有效精选。
const resources = listManagedResources().filter((entry) => entry.published && !entry.lifecycle.discontinuedAt);
const settings = getSettings();
const featuredUnavailable = Boolean(settings.featuredResourceId) && !resources.some((entry) => entry.id === settings.featuredResourceId);
---
<AdminLayout title="首页编排" session={session}>
  <div class="notice"><strong>首页的精选与场景文案从这里改，不再写死在代码里。</strong><p>精选资源只列出已发布内容；场景文案对应首页五张“按你要做的事找”入口，并会出现在 <code>/scenarios/&lt;分类&gt;/</code> 落地页。修改会立即生效，不需要重新构建。</p></div>
  <form class="panel" action="/api/manage/" method="post" data-admin-form>
    <input type="hidden" name="csrf" value={session.csrfToken}/><input type="hidden" name="action" value="save-settings"/>
    <div class="form-grid">
      <div class="field full"><label for="featured">首页精选资源</label><select id="featured" name="featuredResourceId"><option value="">不指定（自动取第一个）</option>{resources.map((entry) => <option value={entry.id} selected={settings.featuredResourceId === entry.id}>{entry.draft.title}</option>)}</select><small>只显示仍在公开目录中的资源；草稿、回收站和已停用资源不能在首页精选。</small>{featuredUnavailable && <p class="error" style="padding:8px 10px">当前精选 {settings.featuredResourceId} 已未发布、被删除或已停用；保存前请重新选择。</p>}</div>
      {categories.map((category) => <div class="field full" style="border-top:1px solid #e6ebe3;padding-top:18px"><strong>{category.name}（{category.id}）</strong><div class="form-grid" style="margin-top:12px"><div class="field"><label for={`task-${category.id}`}>任务文案</label><input id={`task-${category.id}`} name={`scenario.${category.id}.task`} value={settings.scenarios[category.id]?.task ?? ''} maxlength="30"/></div><div class="field"><label for={`detail-${category.id}`}>补充说明</label><input id={`detail-${category.id}`} name={`scenario.${category.id}.detail`} value={settings.scenarios[category.id]?.detail ?? ''} maxlength="60"/></div><div class="field"><label for={`glyph-${category.id}`}>字标（1–2 字）</label><input id={`glyph-${category.id}`} name={`scenario.${category.id}.glyph`} value={settings.scenarios[category.id]?.glyph ?? ''} maxlength="2"/></div></div></div>)}
    </div>
    <div class="actions"><button type="submit">保存首页编排</button><a class="button secondary" href="/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看首页 ↗</a></div><p role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
  </form>
</AdminLayout>
